{title: We Can See You (FJ_102_en)}
{song_number: 102}
{language: en}
{tempo: 94}
{artist: Daniela May, Annika Baer, Evelyn Pfaffenrot, Anita Schneider und Matthias Jäger}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[D]The sun in the day, [Bm]the moon in the night:
[F#m]we can see you [G/A]there.
[D]When earth awakes [Bm]after its sleep:
[F#m]we can see you [G/A]there.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]We can see you. [D/F#]We can see you.
[G]You make yourself visible, [D/F#]within our reach.
[G]You are [A]beautiful beyond words!
[A]We can see you. [D/F#]We can see you.
[G]You are creator, [D/F#]master, [G]king.
[Bm]We are allowed [A]to see [D]you.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[D]A raging storm, [Bm]a warming light:
[F#m]we can see you [G/A]there.
[D]Up to the summit, [Bm]you open our view:
[F#m]we can see you [G/A]there.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]We can see you. [D/F#]We can see you.
[G]You make yourself visible, [D/F#]within our reach.
[G]You are [A]beautiful beyond words!
[A]We can see you. [D/F#]We can see you.
[G]You are creator, [D/F#]master, [G]king.
[Bm]We are allowed [A]to see [D]you.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[D]In sky and sea, [Bm]in every living creature:
[F#m]we can see you [G/A]there.
[D]In people you formed [Bm]in your own image:
[F#m]we can see you [G/A]there.
[Em7]You reveal yourself [G]in every detail. [A]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]We can see you. [D/F#]We can see you.
[G]You make yourself visible, [D/F#]within our reach.
[G]You are [A]beautiful beyond words!
[A]We can see you. [D/F#]We can see you.
[G]You are creator, [D/F#]master, [G]king.
[Bm]We are allowed [A]to see [D]you.
{end_of_chorus}
